    "turn_text": "uh... first of all i would like all of the tenant governor from around the country last night and not one of them was able to identify that they even had the guidance yet let alone the system up. So I'm not saying that maybe that's not the information you have. I don't have any information that we've A, received the guidance, exactly how it's gonna work or B, that anyone has it up. So I would, if you have access to information that shows where that's happened, please send it my way because I am unaware that any state has done that. But we are working with the private sector to build the system. And to the best of my knowledge, I think we're prepared to be as a state, rolling this out as fast as anybody. So that's the information I have. I'm happy to go check and find out more information about that. But that's where it stands right now. But believe me. You know, I feel the frustration that sometimes comes our way because you You see that somebody passes a bill and then you think that well that money is out there and we're just going to get it. But to at this point there is no distribution system we're building that. The good news is for those folks is that to the moment that they were eligible for it, they will receive the benefit from that day forward so that the actual payment may not get here for a while but they can have the reassurance to know that's coming.",
