    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/2/42598.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 35,
    "turn_text": "Jim Provence with the Toledo Blade, a question for Dr. Acton. And this is a follow up to the question about testing a few minutes ago. Until we have broad testing out there, when can an essential business today, such as a healthcare provider, know that it's safe to bring back a worker who has stayed home for two weeks, quarantined for two weeks, but doesn't have a test to prove that they are no longer take contagious. When do we know they're not contagious?",
