    "turn_text": "So I have a bit of an update on the 1099 question that I got a little bit earlier. There are a couple of states who had these systems already established because they had hurricanes or things like that that do have some form of this up. But the states that have not built those systems in the past are the ones that are having to start from scratch. So those are some of the challenges that states like Ohio are having.",
