      },
      {
        "text": "Rapid deployment of the polio vaccine saved many lives.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The FDA followed standard procedures during the emergency authorization process.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Emergency approvals involve compressing timelines without skipping essential steps.",
