    "turn_idx": 58,
    "turn_text": "I can add and then I'm sure Dr. Acton has some things that she would want to add to that but I'm very blessed to have a great supportive wife and family and I know I'm blessed with that but honestly every time I hear somebody complain I always say I know there are a lot of people out there who have it a lot worse than you do or I do and I always think about them. I always think about what somebody who's really struggling has to deal with and I just feel a sense of responsibility to do everything we can to serve them and that's what public service is supposed to be about.",
