    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/2/42598.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 70,
    "turn_text": "Hi. This is Jesse Belmer at the Cincinnati Inquirer. My question is probably for Dr. Acton, perhaps the lieutenant governor as well. I guess why have we not yet been able to have access to these finger prick or serological tests and when can we expect to have access to them?",
