    "turn_text": "Max Felby from the Columbus Dispatch, for the Governor and Dr. Acton. As projections of the peak in coronavirus cases have changed this week, we've heard a lot from readers and other people around the state who are seeming to kind of doubt the initial threat from the virus. And I wanted to ask what kind of message you or Dr. Acton might have for some of those doubters out there?",
