    "turn_text": "factors were added. No, no, that isn't my impression. And I also would say that that flatness, what we're going to see is trends. And I just want people at home to understand you're going to see a lot of hospitalizations and deaths. Even when we're doing good things, it's all sort of following in time. Similarly, if we stop doing what we're doing, Most of us are still not immune, and you will see, it will take two weeks, so you wouldn't see it right away. And my guess is, and as you watch around the world, places that go too quickly and remove these things too quickly, They see that spike. So just keep watching what's happening. And you'll see places having to go back around like a Japan and others and have to go back through what we're doing now. Doing what we do now well gets us the farthest, it helps us the most in economics and the most in saving lives. So we just have to do this part well, Ohio. Thank you.",
