    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/2/42598.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 88,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, there is a chat function. on the website that allows you to do some of that interaction and we hope that people are taking advantage of that. That's a great way to do it. You know, your question, we had a couple questions like this. What we need to do for you and what we need to do is to clear this up much better in terms of helping people understand what that is clearly. The website is supposed to supply that information to help you navigate it. But I know when people get frustrated that sometimes that may not seem like enough. We're expanding the call center so that you can talk to a live person. They're building, these things are being built out. I believe those services are available to help you navigate that. It's just that there are not enough of them right now to solve this problem as we continue to add people to the unemployment comp system. We hope that we will clear through those things. But I always want to remind folks of this, that your benefits will be backdated to the point that you are eligible. So maybe you're not getting through the system as quickly as you would like. But you can count on the fact that if you're eligible for it, you're going to get it.",
