    "turn_text": "Hi, Governor, Andy Chow with Ohio Public Radio and Television State House News Bureau. On the counting of new of these probable cases, the counting of these probable cases, how much weight, how much influence do you think the count of probable cases will have in future orders, future public policy? In other words, if we see a huge spike in probable cases, should we expect a dramatic shift in policy?",
