        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "New data categories will become available within a few days.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Existing data collection methods will remain unchanged.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Dr. Atkins suggested that recent increases in cases may have slowed significantly.",
