        "text": "Philadelphia held a large war bond parade during the 1918 pandemic.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The decision to hold the 1918 parade is considered one of the major mistakes made during the pandemic.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Congregation of crowds increases the risk of disease transmission.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
