        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Public events like parades inherently involve mass congregation.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker's audience accepts historical precedent as relevant to present-day judgment.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker has sufficient credibility to draw conclusions based on past events without needing detailed data.",
