  {
    "episode_id": 42598,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/2/42598.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 99,
    "turn_text": "Thank you very much for your leadership. This is Louise Gail from Ohio Latino TV. These questions for the lieutenant governor. If you explain already governors and about the unemployment and people trying to file on the phones, being busy, people are still frustrated and asking us to ask this question is, as the days go by, up to three, four, five days, calling constantly and not a single, you know, answer, have you thought about perhaps spending a second shift in different hours? And the second question, what would this do to the unemployment and pre-enforcement business?",
