        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Citizens' ability to file claims promptly is essential to maintaining trust in public institutions.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Frustration among callers reflects broader systemic failures in service delivery.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Unemployment processing efficiency impacts both individual livelihoods and local economic activity.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
